1
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,450
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:46,800
[Episode 19]

3
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:47,320
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:01:03,150 --> 00:01:06,830
♪ A meteor streaks
across the promises of the past ♪

6
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:09,500
♪ Memories wither at a touch ♪

7
00:01:10,190 --> 00:01:12,420
♪ Seasons keep changing ♪

8
00:01:12,670 --> 00:01:16,920
♪ I still remember your palm ♪

9
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:20,800
♪ Time has passed ♪

10
00:01:21,220 --> 00:01:25,260
♪ The unexpectedly regret came to me ♪

11
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:24,190
It looks beautiful.

12
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:25,760
Isn't this too flashy?

13
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,950
♪ The warmth ♪

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:26,720
I'm afraid...

15
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,020
I knew you would say that.

16
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:31,570
♪ is still in my mind ♪

17
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:36,340
♪ At that time, happiness was too easy ♪

18
00:01:36,650 --> 00:01:38,930
♪ We knew best how to waste it all ♪

19
00:01:39,850 --> 00:01:41,910
♪ Before we learned to cherish it ♪

20
00:01:41,970 --> 00:01:44,620
♪ We let each other slip away ♪

21
00:01:45,330 --> 00:01:46,120
Just put it on

22
00:01:45,450 --> 00:01:47,210
♪ The last time ♪

23
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,060
and then take it off right away.

24
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:48,160
Wouldn't that be a bad omen?

25
00:01:47,330 --> 00:01:50,910
♪ I walked with you around some corner ♪

26
00:01:48,650 --> 00:01:50,310
Do you still believe in these?

27
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:54,420
♪ A hug replaced all the outcomes ♪

28
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:56,550
♪ We both once had it all ♪

29
00:01:56,810 --> 00:01:58,100
♪ This time we drifted apart ♪

30
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:58,840
Zhuo Yu'an

31
00:01:58,650 --> 00:02:01,210
♪ Just don't forget me ♪

32
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,160
I'm sorry.

33
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:02,120
It didn't even cross my mind.

34
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:04,800
♪ The wind blew you and me apart ♪

35
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,900
I didn't get you anything.

36
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:05,800
It's okay.

37
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:08,870
♪ We once ran, cried,
and laughed together ♪

38
00:02:06,150 --> 00:02:07,200
I'm here.

39
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,940
I've prepared everything.

40
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:12,280
♪ Walked all the way through
every twist and turn ♪

41
00:02:12,410 --> 00:02:16,200
♪ Yet still missed each other
just as happiness drew near ♪

42
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,950
♪ Only after knowing what it is to lose ♪

43
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:19,680
♪ And never being able to touch again ♪

44
00:02:19,790 --> 00:02:23,660
♪ Can we truly understand
what it means to have ♪

45
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:25,790
♪ We loved ♪

46
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:29,790
♪ Scattered and frozen
beneath the starry sky ♪

47
00:02:37,390 --> 00:02:38,160
Hello?

48
00:02:38,570 --> 00:02:39,640
Hello, Miss Shu.

49
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:42,400
Do you remember
the little black cat you rescued?

50
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,840
It's recovering very well now.

51
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,640
However,

52
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:47,060
there are others who want to adopt it now.

53
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,470
If you don't want to adopt it,

54
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:50,070
we will give it to a new owner.

55
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,980
Do I have to go there right now?

56
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:53,760
Yes.

57
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:54,760
Ah, yes.

58
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:56,829
You still have time if you come now.

59
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,320
Okay, I got it.

60
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:00,800
Okay.

61
00:03:02,650 --> 00:03:04,110
You're really something.

62
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:05,920
Thanks, Mr. Zhou.

63
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,000
Next time, my treat.

64
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,130
Oh, it's no big deal.

65
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:16,579
She'll come pick you up later.

66
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,460
I'll stay with you.

67
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,440
But...

68
00:03:23,650 --> 00:03:24,780
all this tonight...

69
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:28,579
There will be many more nights like this.

70
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,240
Hello.

71
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,160
Excuse me.

72
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,360
Hello.

73
00:03:44,079 --> 00:03:45,000
Hello.

74
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,640
Why is it you?

75
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,430
Yi...

76
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,280
Muyang?

77
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:51,600
Yes.

78
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:53,920
The doctor had something come up,

79
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:54,560
so

80
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:56,720
I'm looking after the clinic for him.

81
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,440
The doctor just called me.

82
00:03:58,510 --> 00:03:59,960
He said someone wants to adopt

83
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,140
the injured little black cat

84
00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:02,340
I brought in earlier.

85
00:04:04,330 --> 00:04:04,790
Yeah.

86
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:05,900
That's the one.

87
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,100
The little one's growing so fast.

88
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,920
When's the new owner coming?

89
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:15,800
Already here.

90
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,519
Could it be you?

91
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,600
That's great.

92
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,480
I'm relieved.

93
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,620
You trust me that much?

94
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,480
Yeah.

95
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,120
You look like

96
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,240
someone who really loves life.

97
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,400
And...

98
00:04:32,550 --> 00:04:33,800
and have the ability to take good care of

99
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,930
other little lives.

100
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,360
Thank you.

101
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,360
By the way, I haven't asked you,

102
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,440
last time you...

103
00:04:41,330 --> 00:04:42,200
I'm fine now.

104
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,000
If it's convenient for you,

105
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,800
could we exchange contact info?

106
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,920
I mean,

107
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,400
if you're willing,

108
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:55,080
you can share some updates
about the kitten with me.

109
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:55,870
Of course.

110
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:56,720
Great.

111
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,159
Let me add you on Wechat.

112
00:04:58,090 --> 00:05:00,140
[Ding Ding Pet Hospital]

113
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,120
Okay.

114
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,440
Done.

115
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,840
Did you come alone?

116
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,780
Do you need me to give you a ride?

117
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:08,440
No, thanks.

118
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,800
Someone came with me.

119
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:14,650
The parking lot is full.

120
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,600
Later,

121
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,400
you might have to walk a bit more.

122
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:21,010
This is the kitten's new owner.

123
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:23,200
Hello.

124
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:24,880
Hello.

125
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,930
Then we have to say goodbye.

126
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:34,640
You must grow up well.

127
00:05:36,010 --> 00:05:36,940
It's such a pity.

128
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,480
We are both too busy

129
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,520
to take care of a new life.

130
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,340
We will have one in the future.

131
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,360
Who's this?

132
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,360
My husband.

133
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,590
Then,

134
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,440
please take good care of the kitten.

135
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,120
Okay.

136
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:03,540
Let's go.

137
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,320
Goodbye.

138
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,770
Your mom doesn't want you anymore.

139
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,700
Let me take care of you from now on.

140
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:47,760
Zhuo Yu'an.

141
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,760
For now,

142
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:52,600
I don't want to make
our relationship public.

143
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:53,640
Okay.

144
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,140
Aren't you going to ask me why?

145
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:00,400
Then let me ask——

146
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,980
how does that gentleman know?

147
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,440
Because

148
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,460
he doesn't have much
overlap with our lives.

149
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,960
We have work dealings

150
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,440
and collaborations.

151
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:17,960
So it's better our colleagues
don't know about us.

152
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,080
Okay.

153
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,560
Your reasons,

154
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,480
I accept them all.

155
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:27,520
Well,

156
00:07:28,330 --> 00:07:29,360
your family...

157
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,320
Will they...

158
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,120
They won't.

159
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,800
My father

160
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,250
is not easy to deal with.

161
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,800
It's actually better

162
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,980
if they don't know.

163
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,340
Zhuo Yu'an.

164
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:46,840
Thank you.

165
00:07:53,290 --> 00:07:54,840
We separated too suddenly,

166
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:58,159
and met again by chance.

167
00:07:59,180 --> 00:08:01,240
We can take our relationship slowly,

168
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:02,640
step by step.

169
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,280
Okay.

170
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,490
From now on, without your permission,

171
00:08:13,490 --> 00:08:14,400
we will maintain

172
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,800
a pure relationship.

173
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,560
Really?

174
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,680
I can't.

175
00:08:55,230 --> 00:08:56,120
Stop it.

176
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,560
Get some sleep.

177
00:09:08,890 --> 00:09:10,490
You have a checkup tomorrow.

178
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,520
How can you sleep?

179
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:22,960
Shu Tinglan.

180
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,280
You're the one who said it first.

181
00:09:39,450 --> 00:09:40,840
Looking at your results,

182
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,370
there are no more problems.

183
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:43,830
Your condition is much better

184
00:09:43,830 --> 00:09:45,200
than before.

185
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:47,750
Have you had any interventions recently?

186
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:51,810
Actually,

187
00:09:51,810 --> 00:09:53,280
my daily habits and pace

188
00:09:53,430 --> 00:09:55,360
are pretty much the same as before.

189
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:56,680
I just moved.

190
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:58,160
Okay.

191
00:09:59,260 --> 00:10:02,110
[Personal information Shu Tinglan]
[Test Result]

192
00:09:59,750 --> 00:10:01,720
This is your last test report.

193
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,120
In fact,

194
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,880
you are psychologically healthy.

195
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:06,160
The reason you experienced

196
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:08,080
symptoms like auditory and
visual hallucinations

197
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:08,800
is because you

198
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:11,000
were subjected to unconscious hypnosis.

199
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,920
Once you leave that hypnotic environment,

200
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,820
the symptoms naturally disappear.

201
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:16,040
Hypnosis?

202
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:19,320
You said that in your work environment,

203
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,440
no one else experienced

204
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,640
similar situations.

205
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,080
So this problem

206
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:24,080
probably occurs

207
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,320
when you are alone.

208
00:10:25,820 --> 00:10:27,120
Think carefully.

209
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:30,460
From when you first got sick
to your recent improvement—

210
00:10:30,460 --> 00:10:31,660
have there been any changes

211
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:32,920
during this time?

212
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,200
Okay.

213
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,200
The door is fixed.

214
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,060
Thank you, sir.

215
00:10:41,060 --> 00:10:42,520
Thanks for your hard work.

216
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:12,220
Did you think of anything?

217
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,080
No.

218
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,370
I'll observe more carefully
in my daily life.

219
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,240
Okay.

220
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,960
Miss Shu.

221
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:40,000
This matter can be serious or minor.

222
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Hypnotizing someone

223
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,400
without their knowledge

224
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,790
is illegal.

225
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:47,890
You need to think about
how to handle this.

226
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,290
I heard your footsteps.

227
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:56,440
Why have you been standing at
the door for so long without coming in?

228
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,640
They are both getting anxious waiting.

229
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:12,040
You're finally back.

230
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:14,000
Mr. Zhuo made us wait for you to eat.

231
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,920
He wouldn't let me serve the food.

232
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,080
I'm starving.

233
00:12:33,870 --> 00:12:34,680
Hey, Yu'an.

234
00:12:35,170 --> 00:12:37,300
You and Shu Tinglan aren't being fair.

235
00:12:37,490 --> 00:12:39,040
Getting married is such a big deal.

236
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:42,170
You think one home-cooked meal
is enough to brush us off?

237
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,880
It's enough that our friends know.

238
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,210
No need to be too flashy.

239
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:47,040
No need to be too flashy.

240
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,260
Alright, alright.

241
00:12:49,270 --> 00:12:50,400
Anyway,

242
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,320
Shushu,

243
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,370
Mr. Zhuo,

244
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,880
Happy wedding!

245
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:54,810
Come on!

246
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,200
Happy wedding!
